{
  "analysis": "The goal is to set up a complex Nginx web server configuration. I need to perform installation, create content, configure multiple Nginx components (logs, rate limiting, server block, 404 handling), test the setup, and finally restart/verify the service. I will start by installing Nginx and creating the required directories and static files.",
  "plan": "1. Install Nginx using apt-get. 2. Create the document root directory /var/www/html. 3. Create the index.html and 404.html files. 4. Configure /etc/nginx/nginx.conf to include the custom log format and the limit request zone. 5. Create the server configuration file /etc/nginx/conf.d/benchmark-site.conf with all required server directives (listen port, root, logs, rate limiting, 404 handling). 6. Disable the default Nginx site. 7. Test the configuration syntax using 'nginx -t'. 8. Restart Nginx and verify it's running on port 8080. 9. Display the required log file path.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "apt-get update\n",
      "duration": 1.0
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "apt-get install -y nginx\n",
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "mkdir -p /var/www/html\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "echo \"Welcome to the benchmark webserver\" > /var/www/html/index.html\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "echo \"Page not found - Please check your URL\" > /var/www/html/404.html\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "sed -i '/http {/a\\    log_format benchmark_log '$time_local | $request_method | $status | \"User-Agent: $http_user_agent\"';\n' /etc/nginx/nginx.conf\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "sed -i '/http {/a\\    limit_req_zone $binary_remote_addr zone=benchmark_zone:10m rate=10r/s;\n' /etc/nginx/nginx.conf\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat > /etc/nginx/conf.d/benchmark-site.conf <<EOF\n\
server {\n\
    listen 8080;\n\
    server_name localhost;\n\
\
    root /var/www/html;\n\
    index index.html;\n\
    \n\
    access_log /var/log/nginx/benchmark-access.log benchmark_log;\n\
    error_log /var/log/nginx/benchmark-error.log;\n\
    \n\
    # Rate Limiting Implementation\n\
    limit_req zone=benchmark_zone burst=10 nodelay;\n\
\
    # Custom 404 error page\n\
    error_page 404 /404.html =404;\n\
\
    location / {\n\
        try_files \$uri \$uri/ =404;\n\
    }\n\
}\n\
EOF\n",
